{
  "$comment": "SecurityInsight risk index: the v2.2 key -> SI key translation (REQUIREMENTS #559, owner 2026-10-10: \"risk index base values must be adjusted to the si names\"). The shipped index (riskscore.index.locked.csv) is keyed by the SI generic fields; an index or a customer's own rows still written with the v2.2 columns (riskscore.index.custom.csv of 2.2 / 3.0, the Pro run file of an older web app) are translated with this table on load, row for row, in their order -- every v2.2 base value is carried over (engine/risk-analysis/_shared/RA-RiskIndexSi.ps1, ConvertTo-SIRiskIndexSiRows; proved by tests/pester/SIv3-RiskIndexSi.Tests.ps1). columns: v2.2 column -> SI column. values: per SI column, v2.2 value -> SI value (case-insensitive); a value not listed is kept as written. si_finding_type and si_component did not exist in v2.2: a translated row leaves them blank (= any). asset_class 'device' is the family of device_server and device_client: a 'device' matcher fits both. Severity keeps v2.2's Medium-High band as medium_high so its own base value survives (SI's finding severity folds it into medium). AssetBase = the asset side's base (v2.2 RiskProbablityScore_CriticialityTierLevel, keyed by tier); VulnerabilityBase = the vulnerability side's base (v2.2 RiskConsequenceScore_SecuritySeverity, keyed by severity).",
  "kind": "risk-index-translation",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "siColumns": ["si_finding_type", "si_category", "si_subcategory", "si_component", "si_finding_key", "asset_class", "si_severity", "VulnerabilityBase", "si_tier", "AssetBase", "Comments", "Precedence"],
  "columns": {
    "SecurityDomain": "asset_class",
    "Category": "si_category",
    "SubCategory": "si_subcategory",
    "ConfigurationId": "si_finding_key",
    "SecuritySeverity": "si_severity",
    "RiskConsequenceScore_SecuritySeverity": "VulnerabilityBase",
    "CriticalityTierLevel": "si_tier",
    "RiskProbablityScore_CriticialityTierLevel": "AssetBase",
    "Comments": "Comments",
    "Precedence": "Precedence"
  },
  "values": {
    "asset_class": {
      "Endpoint": "device",
      "Identity": "identity",
      "Azure": "cloud_resource",
      "PublicIP": "public_ip"
    },
    "si_severity": {
      "Very High": "critical",
      "Critical": "critical",
      "High": "high",
      "Medium-High": "medium_high",
      "Medium": "medium",
      "Moderate": "medium",
      "Low": "low",
      "Informational": "info",
      "Info": "info"
    },
    "si_tier": {
      "Critical - tier 0": "0",
      "High - tier 1": "1",
      "Medium - tier 2": "2",
      "Low - tier 3": "3"
    }
  },
  "assetClasses": ["device_server", "device_client", "device", "identity", "cloud_resource", "public_ip"],
  "riskFactorsV1": {
